    :hasEvidenceText "(FL) [ 12 ] provides a solution for training a model with decentralized data on multiple devices"^^xsd:string,
        "Federated Learning (FL) is a distributed learning paradigm that addresses this data isolation problem."^^xsd:string,
        "Federated learning (FL) is the task of learning a model over multiple disjoint local datasets"^^xsd:string,
        "centralized federated graph neural networks [Mei et al. , 2019; Zheng et al. , 2021"^^xsd:string,
