    :hasEvidenceText "Attention Mechanism on Graphs Our method is also conceptually connected to attention mechanism on graphs"^^xsd:string,
        "Each node in a GAT layer learns to weighted combine the embedding (or feature) of its neighborhoods with an attention mechanism"^^xsd:string,
        "GAMLP denes three principled attention mechanisms"^^xsd:string,
        "GAT [35] introduces the attention mechanism to GCN to make it possible to learn the weight for each neighbors automatically."^^xsd:string,
        "efcient attention-guided sorting for GNNs"^^xsd:string,
        "existing GNNs usually use the attention mechanism for local aggregation"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
