    kg:chunkId "2005.12386_rag::chunk_004" ;
    kg:docId "2005.12386_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2005_12386_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "of CustomizedGNN is it generates customized adaptor parameters for each graph sample g i via an adaptor network with the graph structure properties as input. These generated adaptor parameters are used to adapt a shared GNN model denoted as GNN (this could be any GNN model that works for the graph classication task) to a model specic for the graph sample g i . The adapted model GNN i incorporates the structure information of graph g i , and thus, is customized for the graph sample g i . With the" .

