    kg:textSpan "FedGNN: Federated Graph Neural Network for Privacy-Preserving Recommendation Chuhan Wu 1 , Fangzhao Wu 2 , Yang Cao 3 , Yongfeng Huang 1 , Xing Xie 2 1 Tsinghua University, Beijing 100084, China 2 Microsoft Research Asia, Beijing 100080, China, 3 Kyoto University, Kyoto 615-8558, Japan {wuchuhan15,wufangzhao}@gmail.com,yang@i.kyoto-u.ac.jp,yfhuang@.tsinghua.edu.cn,xing.xie@microsoft.com ABSTRACT Local User-Item Graph Client 1 Graph neural network (GNN) is widely used for recommendation to model " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2102_04925_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
