    kg:textSpan "has emerged in recent years as a powerful distributed learning algorithm that aims at nding a global model that ts local data. The FL algorithm consists of two steps: an update step done locally at each client, and an aggregation step done at the server. During these two steps, communication occurs between the clients and the one server. Unfortunately, such a structure is not robust, since it relies on one server to carry out all the communications and aggregations. One solution was suggested in" .

