    kg:textSpan "(2021) proposed a server-aided privacy-preserving GNN for the node-level task on a horizontally partitioned cross-silo scenario via a secure pooling aggregation mechanism. They assumed that all data holders have the same feature domains and edge types but differ in nodes, edges, and labels. In the centralized setting, Sajadmanesh et al. (2022) obtained low-dimensional node features independent of the graph structure and preserve the privacy of the node features by applying DP-SGD for node-level " .

