    kg:textSpan "to meet the first requirement. Furthermore, inspired by the fact that intermediate representations can provide hints for knowledge transfer [ 37 ], we take advantage of node representations and logits derived from deep teacher models to improve the training of compact student networks. Finally, to meet the third requirement, we develop a topology-aware discriminator, which stimulates student networks to mimic teachers and produce similar local affinity of connected nodes and global affinity of p" .

