    kg:textSpan "A.6 for more details. 6. Conclusion We present GIST , a distributed training approach for GCNs that enables the exploration of larger models and datasets. GIST is compatible with existing sampling approaches and leverages a feature-wise partition of model parameters to construct smaller sub-GCNs that are trained independently and in parallel. We have shown that GIST achieves remarkable speed-ups over large graph datasets and even enables the training of GCN models of unprecedented size. We hope " .

