    kg:textSpan "graph-level labels based on the features and structures of graphs. One real scenario of graph classication is molecular property prediction, which is an important task in cheminformatics and AI medicine. In the area of bioinformatics, graph classication can be used to learn the representation of proteins and classify them into enzymes or non-enzymes. For collaboration networks, sub-networks can be classied regarding the information of research areas, topics, genre, etc. More applicable scenarios" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2107_11789_rag__chunk_005> a kg:Chunk ;
