    kg:textSpan "Graph4Rec: A Universal Toolkit with Graph Neural Networks for Recommender Systems Weibin Li, Mingkai He, Zhengjie Huang, Xianming Wang, Shikun Feng, Zhihua Wu, Weiyue Su, Yu Sun Baidu Inc., China { liweibin02, hemingkai, huangzhengjie, wangxianming, fengshikun01, wuzhihua02, suweiyue, sunyu02 } @baidu.com arXiv:2112.01035v2 [cs.LG] 8 Dec 2021 Abstract predict the likely-to-interact items for a user based on ratings given to that item by the other users with similar tastes, which are measured by " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2112_01035_rag__chunk_010> a kg:Chunk ;
