    kg:textSpan "graph representations learned by advanced graph kernels (such as Weisfeiler-Leman kernel (WL) [ 36 ] and propagation kernel (PK) [ 23 ]) or graph representation learning methods (such as Graph2Vec [ 22 ] and InfoGraph [ 38 ]). The key issue with these methods is that the graph representations are learned independently from the anomaly detectors, leading to suboptimal representations. Alternatively, there are studies on extracting graph-level patterns for GAD [ 25 ]. However, the performance of t" .

