    kg:textSpan "where the running time is the training time until convergence using a single 1080Ti GPU. We notice that our subgraph mini-batch method significantly reduces the number of the edges and the nodes processed at each iteration. Compared with GCN, the data volume that NodeAug processes at each training step is smaller, and the running time that it consumes is shorter, since only the data within the receptive fields are processed, out of which the data do not contribute to the loss computation. Becaus" .

