    kg:textSpan "AND NODE REPRESENTATIONS The proposed framework is instantiated into a method called Global and Local Knowledge Distillation (GLocalKD), in which we use widely-used graph convolutional network (GCN) to learn node and graph representations and the joint distillation is driven by two mean square error-based loss functions. 4.1 Graph Neural Network Architecture 4.1.1 Random Target Network. We first establish a target network with randomly initialized weights to obtain graph- and node-level represen" .

