<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2111_04964_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "2111.04964_rag::chunk_003" ;
    kg:docId "2111.04964_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2111_04964_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "We benchmark GNN distillation on large-scale datasets which test out-of-distribution generalization. Our experiments compare 6 distillation techniques across 4 tasks and 14 architectures for teachers and students. Training lightweight GNNs with G-CRD consistently outperform the structure preserving objectives, LSP and GSP, as well as baselines adapted from 2D computer vision. We further analyze the robustness, transferability, quantizability, and representational similarity of teacher and studen" .

